{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34026","headline":"寄润卿博士 · 皮日休","name":"寄润卿博士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高眠可爲要玄纁，鹊尾金炉一世焚。\n尘外乡人爲许掾，山中地主是茅君。\n将收芝菌唯防雪，欲晒图书不奈云。\n若使华阳终卧去，汉家封禅用谁文。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34026.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34026","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}